  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1808.01 Requirements for All Major Asbestos Abatement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1808.01 Requirements for All Major Asbestos Abatement. Except as provided in Env-A 1810.01, each owner or operator of a facility at which any type of major asbestos abatement is or may be undertaken shall ensure compliance with this part and part Env-A 1812.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
